[{"id":"1261104967399534597","date":1589505829000,"rawContent":"@Talkmaster #MeToo is about believing women. We never said believe liars. The problem with your logic is: you choose to believe ALL women are liars where as we choose to hear all women and believe those telling the truth. #BelieveWomen #MeToo","media":null,"username":"AlephsMom","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":15,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1261105104582631424","date":1589505861000,"rawContent":"@kckokomo @Talkmaster You mean predators? Yes, we will. #MeToo #BelieveWomen","media":null,"username":"AlephsMom","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":16,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1261286677818961920","date":1589549152000,"rawContent":"My hope is the Tara Reade distraction only made the #MeToo movement stronger. That it showed society, we are not saying believe a false accusation just because 99% of all women KNOW the accusation to be a VERY LIKELY scenario. We are not out to screw men. We want to protect women","media":null,"username":"AlephsMom","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1261288292663713794","date":1589549537000,"rawContent":"VERY LIKELY SCENARIOS women have experienced: being touched without permission. Being touched when explicitly told no. Being touched by a superior. Being touched by a \u201cfriend\u201d. Being touched by a \u201cnice guy\u201d. 99% of us KNOW THIS to be true. But we still recognize bullshit. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"AlephsMom","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1261294792538902529","date":1589551086000,"rawContent":"@KellyannePolls Don\u2019t vote for sexual predators. You\u2019d think that wouldn\u2019t have to be said out loud but we all know what happened with sexual predator Donald. \n\nDaily reminder: #MeToo was never about believing false accusations. It\u2019s about not assuming all accusations are false! #BelieveWomen","media":null,"username":"AlephsMom","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1261295218743144449","date":1589551188000,"rawContent":"@DailyCaller Don\u2019t vote for sexual predators. You\u2019d think that wouldn\u2019t have to be said out loud but we all know what happened with sexual predator Donald. \n\nDaily reminder: #MeToo\u00a0 was never about believing false accusations. It\u2019s about not assuming all accusations are false! #BelieveWomen","media":null,"username":"AlephsMom","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLive