our abuse seriously and stop waiting until we\u2019re dead to investigate!","media":null,"username":"AlephsMom","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":23,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1263713713032323073","date":1590127802000,"rawContent":"@deepa_shivaram When my son was learning about the #BlackLivesMatter movement in his gov\u2019t class, i relayed a story about a young black man getting shot by the police for jaywalking! Told my son, \u201ci jaywalked in front of a cop once. Know what happened? He told me not to jaywalk.\u201d #Amerikkka.","media":null,"username":"AlephsMom","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":2,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":23,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1265814661212979201","date":1590628707000,"rawContent":"@KHiveQueenBee Daaaamn! Yes! When #BlackLivesMatter THEN all lives matter! YES!!!","media":null,"username":"AlephsMom","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":3,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":23,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1267849964132003841","date":1591113961000,"rawContent":"@m_d_mccoy When discussing WHY #BlackLivesMatter exists with my 12yo, i shared with him the story of Johnnie Rush. i told him, i jaywalked in front of a cop, once. You know what happened to me? Cop told me n